The relevant existing CSS is:
/* current: no rule sizes .doc-name; it inherits the table cell's inline flow */

Write a patch that raises the document-name button's hit
area.  Add ONE rule for the selector .doc-name with the properties
min-height: 28px; and display: inline-flex; and align-items: center;
Do not change any other selector.

Write the patch now.  The first line is already written; continue from it:
